{
  "name": "Day 39 Solution: AI Memory, Context & RAG",
  "description": "Real n8n AI nodes: an AI Agent with Simple Memory keyed by conversation_id, a one-off loader that embeds a small knowledge base into the In-Memory Vector Store, and a RAG agent that answers only from that store.",
  "tags": [
    "week-06",
